# The offline Jira `mnml --demo` starts beside it. {{jira}} and
# {{jira_basic}} come from .mnml/env/dev.env, written once it listens.

### Who am I
GET {{jira}}/rest/api/3/myself
Authorization: Basic {{jira_basic}}
Accept: application/json

### My open issues
POST {{jira}}/rest/api/3/search/jql
Authorization: Basic {{jira_basic}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jql": "assignee = currentUser() AND resolution = Unresolved ORDER BY updated DESC"
}

### One issue, with its comments
GET {{jira}}/rest/api/3/issue/ENG-2?fields=summary,status,comment
Authorization: Basic {{jira_basic}}
Accept: application/json
